      "beat_id": "B00",
      "act": "cold open",
      "scene": "ClaudeComposerAsk",
      "narration_text": "Nǐ hǎo, Liam. This is Liam, in for Professor Bear. Everything here runs through computational skepticism, and this is where it bites. Plato's move — what's the artifact, what's the world, what's the relationship between them? An agent can report success about itself and be wrong about the world. Here's what actually changes when Claude can reach your real systems.",
